{"repositoryId":1239688716,"availability":"available","full":"Dukeabaddon/Gate-MCP","name":"Gate-MCP","description":"Local MCP server that compresses AI-coding context by 89% before it hits the LLM. 5-layer compression (schema/nav/AST/JSON/OCR), 99.1% symbol-recall fidelity, works in every MCP-aware IDE.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"TypeScript","stars":3,"forks":0,"created":"2026-05-15T10:41:56Z","updated":"2026-10-12T06:09:45Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://gate-mcp-site.vercel.app/","topics":[],"demo":"https://gate-mcp-site.vercel.app/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T11:46:12.873Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-12T11:46:12.873Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-12T11:46:12.873Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-12T11:46:12.873Z","stars":3,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Measure and reduce context without hiding fidelity failures.","Gate-MCP — local context compression gateway for AI coding assistants","Gate sits between your agent and the expensive parts of an MCP turn: tool schemas, file bodies, JSON tool results, and screenshots. It compresses what you ask it to, caches unchanged work in SQLite, and labels every savings number with an honest billingScope. Opt-in only — Gate does not intercept editor Read / Bash."],"features":["Schema budget first — catalog mode attacks the tax every MCP turn pays before you read a single file","Measured, not vibed — compression tools return real BPE counts; inflation is never sold as savings","Navigate then hydrate — symbol graph + optional graphify bridge before full Read","Durable cache — SQLite/WAL dedup across IDE restarts (fail-closed unless you opt into memory)","Local-only — no cloud, no telemetry, path jail under GATEPROJECTROOT"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Dukeabaddon/Gate-MCP/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"9ac367c959ae4a6814b0d17585d5d57dc712d826377a08b47aea3d62e6eaf8a8","extractedAt":"2026-10-12T11:46:1